 "caption": "Starting at x₀ = 0 the iterates 1, 1.5, 1.75, 1.875, … step between the line y = x/2 + 1 and the diagonal y = x, each time halving the distance to the fixed point 2, where the two lines meet.",
 "alt": "The line y = x/2 + 1 and the diagonal y = x meet at (2, 2). A staircase path starting at the origin climbs between them to the meeting point.",
 "description": [
  "T(x) = x/2 + 1 is a contraction with k = ½: distances to 2 halve at every step.",
  "From x₀ = 0, go up to the line (T(0) = 1), then across to the diagonal to make the new input, 1.",
  "Repeat: 1.5, 1.75, 1.875, … the staircase closes in on the crossing point.",
  "The lines meet at x = 2, and T(2) = 2: the unique fixed point."
